        "term_scope": "Japanese cherry blossom floral ornament; not one fixed textile repeat",
        "definition": {
          "ja": "桜の花・花びら・枝などを図案化した文様。桜の花弁を五枚で表すことが多く、花弁先端の切れ込みが識別の手掛かりになる表現があります。写実的な枝垂桜や花びらだけの散らし柄も含みます。",
          "en": "A Japanese decorative motif depicting cherry blossoms, petals or branches. Five-petaled blossoms, sometimes with a notch at each petal tip, are one common rendering; realistic flowering branches and scattered petals are also used."
        },
        "distinguishing_features": {
          "ja": [
            "五枚の花弁で構成する桜花は代表的な図案の一つ",
            "花弁先端の小さな切れ込みは梅との見分け方の手掛かり。ただし全例に必須ではありません",
            "散り花・枝垂桜・枝付きの花など、構図に幅があります"
          ],
          "en": [
            "Five-petaled blossoms are one common depiction",
            "Notched petal tips often distinguish stylized sakura from round-petaled plum, but not every rendering has notches",
            "Scattered petals, flowering branches and hanging blossoms are all possible compositions"
          ]
        },
