        "term_scope": "Japanese plum blossom ornament in multiple realistic or stylized forms",
        "definition": {
          "ja": "梅の花や枝を図案化した文様。丸みのある五枚の花弁を単純化した梅花、枝付きの梅、紅白の梅などが使われます。桜文様とは花弁の輪郭と枝の表現が識別の手掛かりになります。",
          "en": "A Japanese motif depicting plum blossoms or flowering branches. Rounded five-petaled blossoms, plum branches, and red or white blossoms are common variants; petal contours and branch details can help distinguish it from cherry blossom motifs."
        },
        "distinguishing_features": {
          "ja": [
            "丸みのある五弁花が典型的な梅花の単純化です",
            "花の中心に花蕊を描く表現が見られます",
            "桜との判別は花弁の形や枝ぶりを総合して行い、色だけでは判別しません"
          ],
          "en": [
            "Rounded five-petaled flowers are a common stylization",
            "A visible central cluster of stamens is a useful cue in detailed examples",
            "Color alone does not reliably distinguish plum from cherry; inspect petals and branches"
          ]
        },
