        "term_scope": "Chrysanthemum floral designs; not restricted to a single petal count or family-crest form",
        "definition": {
          "ja": "菊の花を装飾的に表した文様。細長い花弁が中心から多方向に広がる放射状の菊花や、葉や茎を含む写実的な菊など、さまざまな図案があります。",
          "en": "A decorative representation of chrysanthemums, ranging from stylized radial flower heads with many slender petals to naturalistic compositions including stems and leaves."
        },
        "distinguishing_features": {
          "ja": [
            "中心から多数の細い花弁が放射状に延びる表現が多い",
            "細弁が重なる複層の花頭や、葉を添えた大輪などの変種があります",
            "五弁花の桜・梅とは花弁の数と長さが主な識別点です"
          ],
          "en": [
            "Many narrow petals radiating from the center are a common cue",
            "Layered petals, large blossoms and leaves appear in varied designs",
            "Numerous slender petals distinguish typical chrysanthemums from five-petaled plum or cherry"
          ]
        },
