          "en": "A Japanese decorative motif representing cranes, shown flying with outstretched wings, standing, or combined with pines and waves; in Japanese textiles it often conveys auspicious longevity."
        },
        "distinguishing_features": {
          "ja": [
            "長い首と脚、広げた翼などが鶴の形態の手掛かりです",
            "羽先を黒く描く、赤い頭頂部を示すなどの表現例がありますが固定条件ではありません",
            "小鳥の千鳥文様とは鳥の体格や翼・脚の表現、構図が異なります"
          ],
          "en": [
            "Long neck, legs and broad outstretched wings can signal a crane",
            "Black wing tips or a red crown are optional illustrative features, not universal requirements",
            "Compared with plover motifs, cranes are usually depicted with longer necks and legs"
          ]
